Subject: Re: [stan-users] It'd be interesting to compare Stan to this BUGS approach for binomial family, log link GLMs.
Message-ID: <Dmgb2SJPO_Y.Wct0mP1uSnIJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Dmgb2SJPO_Y.l0hiqigP2IUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <Dmgb2SJPO_Y.l0hiqigP2IUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
