From u22d6bf0e16759db6 at groups.google.com  Thu May 21 18:49:55 2015
From: u22d6bf0e16759db6 at groups.google.com (Ed Baskerville)
Date: Thu, 21 May 2015 18:49:55 +0000
Subject: Re: survival analysis model with latent variables and discontinuous hazard
Message-ID: <vMMP3czwVgI.FUkV49IKMmAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <vMMP3czwVgI._hTv2M1-brUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <vMMP3czwVgI.VHfXHf1zKxAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <vMMP3czwVgI._hTv2M1-brUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
