That looks close, though in your place I would 1) make sure the time indexing is exactly what you want, i.e.-is phi[t] for surviving from t-1 to t or from t to t+1, and 2) Stan has a "print" statement so I would do the calculation in R for a few individuals and make sure printing the bernoulli parameter gives you what you expect.

>
