From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Thu May 28 17:20:22 2015
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Thu, 28 May 2015 17:20:22 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Real-valued parameter for Poisson
Message-ID: <R7_7qf8y498.GFTWECKP2YEJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
