From u715287d64ddcb0b1 at groups.google.com  Thu May 28 20:23:11 2015
From: u715287d64ddcb0b1 at groups.google.com (Peter Smits)
Date: Thu, 28 May 2015 20:23:11 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Jolly-Seber model, state-space representation
Message-ID: <m0wvY8VdVNE.RZDKMgvhHa4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
