Subject: Re: [stan-users] Theoretic question about HMC
Message-ID: <YcjoC_312P4.9m8H1K_VWEwJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <YcjoC_312P4.K1hk2f0_0h8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
