Subject: Re: [stan-users] Jolly-Seber model, state-space representation
Message-ID: <m0wvY8VdVNE.IuzKGTMS0T8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <m0wvY8VdVNE.m7cTYdU_XNoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <m0wvY8VdVNE.m7cTYdU_XNoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
